        "requiredForDiagnosis": false
      }
    ],
    "minimumForDiagnosis": "Presence of congenital bilateral cataracts, MRI-confirmed hypomyelination, and early neurological impairment",
    "notes": "Genetic confirmation supports diagnosis but is not mandatory if clinical and imaging criteria are met"
